10:Taf8,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』七周年感謝祭 −夢語刀宴會−","description":"シリーズ七周年を記念し、富士急ハイランド・コニファーフォレストで開催された刀ステ史上最大の祭典。 総勢45振りの刀剣男士が集結し、これまでの劇中歌を披露する圧巻のライブパートに加え、各本丸の物語が交差する書き下ろしの劇パートも展開。大型ビジョンや特効を駆使した野外ならではの演出と、シリーズの歴史を凝縮した熱量の高いパフォーマンスで、審神者と共にこれまでの歩みを祝し、未来へと繋ぐ記念碑的な特別公演。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-7th-anniversary","keywords":"ライブ感強め, 歌唱厚め, 群像のうまみ, エモい","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 拡樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-hiroki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"磯野 大","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/isono-dai"},{"@type":"Person","name":"高本 学","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takamoto-gaku"},{"@type":"Person","name":"佐野 真白","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sano-mashiro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"本田 礼生","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/honda-reo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"杉江 大志","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sugie-taishi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"前嶋 曜","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/maejima-yoh"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北川 尚弥","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitagawa-naoya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"三津谷 亮","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/mitsuya-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"大崎 捺希","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/osaki-natsuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"木津 つばさ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kizu-tsubasa"},{"@type":"Person","name":"設楽 銀河","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/shitara-ginga"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北村 諒","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitamura-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"橋本 祥平","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/hashimoto-shohei"},{"@type":"Person","name":"松井 勇歩","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/matsui-yuho"},{"@type":"Person","name":"輝馬","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/teruma"},{"@type":"Person","name":"瀬戸 祐介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/seto-yusuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"佐々木 喜英","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sasaki-yoshihide"},{